1e:["$","p","His knowledge of soccer is exceptional. He understands the game, the rules, and the strategies at a deep level and communicates them in a way that players can understand and apply on the field. He teaches not only the technical and tactical aspects of soccer, but also the importance of decision-making, teamwork, and accountability.",{"children":"His knowledge of soccer is exceptional. He understands the game, the rules, and the strategies at a deep level and communicates them in a way that players can understand and apply on the field. He teaches not only the technical and tactical aspects of soccer, but also the importance of decision-making, teamwork, and accountability."}]
1f:["$","p","One of the qualities I respect most is his ability to handle difficult situations with confidence and professionalism. Whether interacting with referees, opposing coaches, or parents, he is never intimidated, yet he is always willing to listen, communicate, and have respectful conversations.",{"children":"One of the qualities I respect most is his ability to handle difficult situations with confidence and professionalism. Whether interacting with referees, opposing coaches, or parents, he is never intimidated, yet he is always willing to listen, communicate, and have respectful conversations."}]
20:["$","p","Most importantly, he teaches lessons that go far beyond soccer. He emphasizes respect for teammates, opponents, officials, the game itself, and oneself. The character, discipline, and sportsmanship he instills in his players will benefit them long after their playing days are over.",{"children":"Most importantly, he teaches lessons that go far beyond soccer. He emphasizes respect for teammates, opponents, officials, the game itself, and oneself. The character, discipline, and sportsmanship he instills in his players will benefit them long after their playing days are over."}]
21:["$","p","If you're looking for a coach who develops skilled athletes while also helping young players become confident, respectful, and hardworking individuals, I cannot recommend him highly enough.",{"children":"If you're looking for a coach who develops skilled athletes while also helping young players become confident, respectful, and hardworking individuals, I cannot recommend him highly enough."}]
